# Follow established code style

Match the patterns already in this repo. Prefer copying nearby files over inventing new structure, naming, or styling approaches.

## Stack patterns

- Hex UI: Emotion (`@emotion/react`), `/** @jsxImportSource @emotion/react */`, co-located `styles.ts` / `*Styles.ts`
- App shell: thin Tailwind utility classes only; do not restyle hex primitives with Tailwind
- Components: client components when using hooks or the Emotion `css` prop; `"use client"` first line
- Composition: build on `Hexagon` / `HexGrid` / `useHexagonPaint` rather than forking clip-path or paint logic
- Stories: colocated `*.stories.tsx` next to the component, `@storybook/nextjs-vite` Meta/StoryObj

## Editing habits

- Reuse existing names, file layout, and export style from sibling modules
- Keep diffs focused; do not drive-by refactor unrelated code
- When unsure, mirror `src/components/hex/` and `src/components/readout-2/` as the reference
